  Power VO path: flex.pool.sens_power_act (replace pool with HK id if different).
  Value placeholder in a Virtual Output command is <v> (verified 2026-10-07 with a capture: the Virtual-Input style \v is sent as the
  control character 0x0B). <v> arrives with a point and 3 decimals (e.g. 6.333). In the XML attribute it is written &lt;v&gt;.
  Pilot (branch spike/vo-push-pilot): target is the daemon port 8541 (not the Streamlit port 8501); append ?t=TOKEN to the command
  (EARNIE_PILOT_PUSH_TOKEN). Repeat (e.g. 30 s) is set per command in Config.
-->
